\# Secrets / local overrides
.claude/settings.local.json

\# Note: .claude/output/ and .claude/shared-context/ are intentionally
\# NOT ignored — each run's artifacts are the evidence for this
\# project's required scenario deliverables (docs/scenarios/), and
\# rules/architecture.md Audit Everything treats the _run-log.md +
\# _decisions.yaml pair as the reproducibility record, not a reason to
\# discard the outputs they describe.

\# Language build artifacts
target/
*.class
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
*.egg-info/

\# IDE
.idea/
*.iml

\# H2 file-mode database (service-java-spring/, jdbc:h2:file:./data/urlshortener --
\# FR-5 durability requirement, risk-register.md R-1). The .mv.db/.trace.db files are
\# a local runtime data store, not source -- analogous to target/ above, not a
\# reproducibility artifact like .claude/output/ is.
service-java-spring/data/
*.mv.db
*.trace.db
